  "seo": {
    "title": "Kaveh Limestone Pavers & Flooring",
    "description": "Kaveh limestone flooring brings together a tapestry of tones, textures and formats, reminiscent of genuine European reclaimed flooring. Kaveh suits projects wanting a richly varied, aged aesthetic. Available in an irregular modular pattern with complementary step treads.",
