  "descriptionSection": {
    "title": "Kaveh",
    "introduction": {
      "type": "document",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Kaveh limestone flooring brings together a tapestry of tones, textures and formats, reminiscent of genuine European reclaimed flooring. Beige, cream, taupe and soft grey pieces sit together in no set pattern, with pitting, veining and tumble marks reinforcing the naturally weathered look. Kaveh suits projects wanting a richly varied, aged aesthetic. Available in an irregular modular pattern with complementary step treads.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "details": {
      "type": "document",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "If you're looking to upgrade your indoor or outdoor space, Eco Outdoor offers natural stone flooring in unique colours, textures, finishes, and formats to spark endless design inspiration. Our curated collection of pavers and tiles includes travertine, limestone, crazy paving, cobblestones, sandstone, split stone, bluestone, terrazzo, terracotta, and granite. We also offer Technifirma porcelain tiles and French oak timber flooring. Visit one of our design showrooms today.",
              "marks": [
                "italic"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "readMore": true,
    "accent": "white",
